    "docs/bianchini/v1/PLANNING_REVIEW.md": {
      "text": "# Revisão do planejamento\n\nAs três tarefas compartilham risco baixo, seam HTTP e gate do plano.\n"
    },
    "docs/bianchini/v1/inputs/APPROVED_SCOPE.md": {
      "text": "# Escopo aprovado\n\nCriar três operações simples na mesma API de registros.\n"
    },
    "docs/bianchini/v1/plans/P01-api.md": {
      "text": "---\nplan_id: P01\nmethod_version: 2\nrisk: low\nexecution: grouped\nreview: plan_gate\ndepends_on: []\n---\n\n# API de registros\n\n### Tarefa 1 — Criar registro\n\n**Execution:** grouped\n**Review:** plan_gate\n**Test seams:** HTTP POST /records\n**Verification:** `pytest -q tests/api/test_create.py`\n\n### Tarefa 2 — Listar registros\n\n**Execution:** grouped\n**Review:** plan_gate\n**Test seams:** HTTP GET /records\n**Verification:** `pytest -q tests/api/test_list.py`\n\n### Tarefa 3 — Excluir registro\n\n**Execution:** grouped\n**Review:** plan_gate\n**Test seams:** HTTP DELETE /records/:id\n**Verification:** `pytest -q tests/api/test_delete.py`\n"
    },
    "docs/bianchini/v1/specs/system.md": {
      "text": "# Design do sistema\n\nAs operações POST, GET e DELETE compartilham o seam HTTP `/records`.\n"
    },
    "docs/living/PROJECT_STATE.md": {
